# web — request examples for the VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
@web = http://localhost:3001

### Dashboard entry page (always revalidated)
GET {{web}}/

### Runtime config injected for the browser (API_BASE_URL)
GET {{web}}/config.js

### Vendored libraries (no CDN)
GET {{web}}/vendor/van.min.js

### Ops
GET {{web}}/health
###
GET {{web}}/ready
###
GET {{web}}/metrics
